{"nodes": [{"id": "changelog_changelog", "label": "CHANGELOG (mattpocock-skills 1.0.0 to 1.1.0)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "changelog_wide_refactors", "label": "Wide refactors (expand-contract slicing)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single mechanical change whose blast radius fans across the codebase breaks thousands of call sites so no vertical slice can land green. Slices by expand-contract: expand the new form beside the old, migrate call sites in batches sized by blast radius, contract the old form away, so CI stays green batch to batch."}, {"id": "changelog_hitl_afk", "label": "HITL / AFK ticket classification", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every ticket type is HITL (human in the loop - grilling, prototype) or AFK (agent alone - research). A HITL ticket only resolves through the live exchange, so wait-for-the-human falls out of the label; a grilling agent that answers its own questions has by definition broken HITL."}, {"id": "changelog_fog_of_war", "label": "Wayfinder fog-of-war map", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wayfinding charts a route through a foggy problem: the map is an index, not a store - a decision lives in exactly one place (its ticket), so the map only gists and links, never restates. Fog vs out of scope is split: Not-yet-specified graduates as the frontier advances; Out of scope never does. Destination is the leading word."}, {"id": "changelog_negation", "label": "Negation (steering by prohibition)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The elephant failure mode: naming what not to do drags the forbidden behaviour into context and makes it more available, not less. The cure is to prompt the positive."}, {"id": "changelog_negative_space", "label": "Negative space (steering by omission)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Blindness to the steering done by what a skill leaves out: every decision a skill declines is delegated to the agent's priors. The cure is to read a draft for its silences and decide each omission deliberately - fill it, or leave it open as a real branch."}, {"id": "changelog_confirmation_gate", "label": "Grilling confirmation gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The agent won't enact the plan until the human confirms shared understanding has been reached, turning the existing completion criterion into an explicit stop-gate."}, {"id": "changelog_facts_vs_decisions", "label": "Facts vs decisions in grilling", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Facts are looked up (explore the codebase); decisions are put to the human and wait for an answer. The old blanket explore-the-codebase line read as license to answer decisions autonomously once another skill runs grilling in a resolve-the-ticket frame."}, {"id": "changelog_planning_skills_unification", "label": "Planning skills unification (to-prd to-spec; to-plan + to-issues to-tickets)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Spec is the single through-line term (to-prd renamed to-spec). to-tickets breaks a plan, spec, or conversation into tracer-bullet vertical slices each declaring its blocking edges; the one artifact reads two ways - local file (edges as text) or real tracker (native blocking links) - the medium only decides whether anything acts on them in parallel."}, {"id": "changelog_review_skill", "label": "review skill (predecessor of code-review)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The in-progress review skill was renamed to code-review, moved into engineering/, and hardened with an always-on Fowler smell baseline."}, {"id": "changelog_decision_mapping", "label": "decision-mapping (predecessor of wayfinder)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Renamed to wayfinder: decision map was jargony and inaccurate - only one ticket type is actually a decision."}, {"id": "changelog_teach_reuse", "label": "Teach reuse-first components", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lessons are built from reusable components in ./assets/ (stylesheets, quiz widgets, simulators, diagram helpers); the agent reads ./assets/ before authoring and extracts anything new and reusable into a component rather than inlining it."}], "edges": [{"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering_ask_matt_ask_matt", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering_tdd_tdd", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering_diagnosing_bugs_diagnosing_bugs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering_domain_modeling_domain_modeling", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering_codebase_design_codebase_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering_grill_with_docs_grill_with_docs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering_prototype_prototype", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering_research_research", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "skills/skills/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "changelog_changelog", "target": "docs_engineering